		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>5-foot-tall gargoyle with a single staring eye in an otherwise featureless face. Feeds on inner turmoil.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 15, <strong>HP</strong> 43, <strong>ATK</strong> 3 talon +6 (1d8 + fever) and feed, <strong>MV</strong> near (climb, fly), <strong>S</strong> +3, <strong>D</strong> +3, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> +2, <strong>W</strong> +2, <strong>Ch</strong> +3, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 9</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Feed</strong>. If a mortal within near has a negative condition, popobala heals 2d6 HP on its turn unless at 0 HP.</p><p></p><p><strong>Fever</strong>. CON 15+ or sickened for 1d4 rounds.</p><p></p><p><strong>Shapechange</strong>. Assume form of a humanoid or dire bat.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
